# Local sample deliverable output (gen:check). STAYS IGNORED: every pack in here
# is generated from a REAL prospect's scraped site, reviews and phone number, and
# none of that belongs in git. The committed stand-in is _fixtures/ below.
_samples/

# _fixtures/ is deliberately NOT ignored. golden-pack.json is a synthetic
# business (invented name, .example domain, invented reviews) built by
# `npm run sample:golden`, and it is what verify:all validates — so the
# verification suite runs in a fresh clone instead of only on one laptop.
# The four rendered HTML deliverables are derived from that JSON on demand
# (`npm run samples:render`), so they are ignored rather than committed.
_fixtures/*.html

# Local Claude Code worktree checkouts (embedded repos — not project files)
.claude/worktrees/
